            "answer": "<p>Sleep on it for up to 30 nights. If you're not breathing and sleeping better, send us one email and we'll refund you in full — no questions asked. We give you the full month because everyone's nose is a little different, and it can take a few nights to find the placement that feels best on your face.</p>"
          }
